sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Authenticated transport
    participant R as Jurisdiction resolver
    participant H as WorkspaceHub
    participant D as D1 batch

    T->>R: AuthorizationContext + typed command
    R->>R: Verify workspace, actor, epoch, persisted jurisdiction
    R->>H: Bounded internal RPC
    H->>H: Enter per-workspace FIFO
    H->>D: Read stored idempotency and next cursor
    alt matching replay
        D-->>H: Stored result + cursor
        H-->>T: Replayed outcome
    else first execution
        H->>D: Guarded mutation + cursor + event + audit + outbox + result
        D-->>H: Atomic commit
        H-->>T: Committed outcome
    end
